#: ../../source/postcss-minify-gradients_README.md:16
msgid ""
"Where possible, this module will minify gradient parameters. It can "
"convert linear gradient directional syntax to angles, remove the "
"unnecessary `0%` and `100%` start and end values, and minimise color "
"stops that use the same length values (the browser will adjust the value "
"automatically)."
msgstr ""

